{
    "title": "PCH+ - Real Prizes, Fun Games",
    "description": "Experience fun mini games for chances to win real prizes as rewarded play takes new meaning with PCH+! Play for chances to win prizes and get real rewards! Enter giveaways with quick and easy games for exciting ways to win prizes at every turn. PCH+ lets you play classic mini games and score big with Tokens that give you even more chances to win.\r\n\r\nExperience the new PCH+ World Map where you have the power to choose your own path and play to win with chances at real prizes waiting around every turn! Players select different themed Sweepstakes Worlds, travel through the map, play mini games, and earn Tokens. Each world contains unique experiences as well as themed prizes. Dive into an underwater world of winnings in Ocean World, relax with the sand and entries in Beach World, or enjoy the tourist sites in Europe world, the choice is yours! Complete each world to unlock treasure chest rewards for more prize entries and Token Rewards that can win you even more amazing giveaways!\r\n\r\nPCH+ is packed with fun games that are easy to learn, but hard to master. Play now to earn real rewards, experience fun prize play, and collect surprise bonuses as you complete each level. Play to win by going for chances at real prizes through simple mini games with big rewards every day. Whether it\u2019s shooting basketball hoops, rolling the ball in skeeball, or trying to go for the Eagle in mini golf, there are endless ways to earn redeemable Tokens for chances to win prizes. Each mini game has been refined to earn you more chances to win sweepstakes and prizes! The higher your score the more entries you earn! Play now!\r\n\r\nThe best part is that it\u2019s easy, free, fun to play, and it\u2019s powered by Publishers Clearing House \u2013 so you know it\u2019s packed with real prizes such as real cash, dream vacation trips, and even brand new vehicles! Anyone can win!\r\n\r\nPlay to win even more when you score Tokens and redeem them for a chance to win Weekly Grand Prizes! Special themed Grand Prize worlds appear every week with new prizes and rewards.\r\n\r\nDownload today to collect Tokens and get chances to win real prizes. PCH+ is the portal to endless fun mini games and where winners come to play!\r\n\r\nPCH+ FEATURES\r\n\r\nFUN MINI GAMES, REAL PRIZES\r\n- Get chances to win real rewards\r\n- Score big on mini games every day\r\n- Enjoy quick games of basketball, skeeball, mini golf, water pong, mole mayhem, and much more\r\n- Higher scores means more chances to win\r\n- Redeem your Tokens for your shot at prizes in the PCHrewards Token Exchange.\r\n\r\nPLAY TO WIN: WEEKLY GRAND PRIZES\r\n- New Winners are announced every week\r\n- Explore new themed Sweepstakes worlds for a chance at new Weekly Grand Prizes - New prizes every Friday!\r\n- Play and earn entries for prizes such as real cash, vacation trips, vehicles, & more\r\n- Score bonus Tokens and redeem them for chances to win real prizes!\r\n\r\nCLAIM YOUR TREASURE CHEST BONUSES\r\n- Collect and earn entries as you open all your destination envelopes\r\n- A surprise bonus (or many!) awaits with each level you complete\r\n- Complete easy & fun games to discover different ways to win\r\n- Your collected Tokens could make you the next BIG WINNER\r\n\r\nThere\u2019s a whole world of mini games, rewarded play, excitement, and chances to win big prizes waiting inside PCH+ and it all starts now. Download free, play now, score big, and get in on the excitement of this brand-new Publishers Clearing House experience.\r\n\r\nRemember, after you install PCH+, turn on your Push Notifications so you never miss your chance to win prizes.\r\n\r\nNeed Support? Visit http://pch.custhelp.com/app/home/site/apps\r\n\r\nTo opt out of targeted ads, the DAA AppChoices tool is available at\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.DAA.appchoices&hl=en",
    "descriptionHTML": "Experience fun mini games for chances to win real prizes as rewarded play takes new meaning with PCH+! Play for chances to win prizes and get real rewards! Enter giveaways with quick and easy games for exciting ways to win prizes at every turn. PCH+ lets you play classic mini games and score big with Tokens that give you even more chances to win.<br><br>Experience the new PCH+ World Map where you have the power to choose your own path and play to win with chances at real prizes waiting around every turn! Players select different themed Sweepstakes Worlds, travel through the map, play mini games, and earn Tokens. Each world contains unique experiences as well as themed prizes. Dive into an underwater world of winnings in Ocean World, relax with the sand and entries in Beach World, or enjoy the tourist sites in Europe world, the choice is yours! Complete each world to unlock treasure chest rewards for more prize entries and Token Rewards that can win you even more amazing giveaways!<br><br>PCH+ is packed with fun games that are easy to learn, but hard to master. Play now to earn real rewards, experience fun prize play, and collect surprise bonuses as you complete each level. Play to win by going for chances at real prizes through simple mini games with big rewards every day. Whether it\u2019s shooting basketball hoops, rolling the ball in skeeball, or trying to go for the Eagle in mini golf, there are endless ways to earn redeemable Tokens for chances to win prizes. Each mini game has been refined to earn you more chances to win sweepstakes and prizes! The higher your score the more entries you earn! Play now!<br><br>The best part is that it\u2019s easy, free, fun to play, and it\u2019s powered by Publishers Clearing House \u2013 so you know it\u2019s packed with real prizes such as real cash, dream vacation trips, and even brand new vehicles! Anyone can win!<br><br>Play to win even more when you score Tokens and redeem them for a chance to win Weekly Grand Prizes! Special themed Grand Prize worlds appear every week with new prizes and rewards.<br><br>Download today to collect Tokens and get chances to win real prizes. PCH+ is the portal to endless fun mini games and where winners come to play!<br><br>PCH+ FEATURES<br><br>FUN MINI GAMES, REAL PRIZES<br>- Get chances to win real rewards<br>- Score big on mini games every day<br>- Enjoy quick games of basketball, skeeball, mini golf, water pong, mole mayhem, and much more<br>- Higher scores means more chances to win<br>- Redeem your Tokens for your shot at prizes in the PCHrewards Token Exchange.<br><br>PLAY TO WIN: WEEKLY GRAND PRIZES<br>- New Winners are announced every week<br>- Explore new themed Sweepstakes worlds for a chance at new Weekly Grand Prizes - New prizes every Friday!<br>- Play and earn entries for prizes such as real cash, vacation trips, vehicles, &amp; more<br>- Score bonus Tokens and redeem them for chances to win real prizes!<br><br>CLAIM YOUR TREASURE CHEST BONUSES<br>- Collect and earn entries as you open all your destination envelopes<br>- A surprise bonus (or many!) awaits with each level you complete<br>- Complete easy &amp; fun games to discover different ways to win<br>- Your collected Tokens could make you the next BIG WINNER<br><br>There\u2019s a whole world of mini games, rewarded play, excitement, and chances to win big prizes waiting inside PCH+ and it all starts now. Download free, play now, score big, and get in on the excitement of this brand-new Publishers Clearing House experience.<br><br>Remember, after you install PCH+, turn on your Push Notifications so you never miss your chance to win prizes.<br><br>Need Support? Visit http://pch.custhelp.com/app/home/site/apps<br><br>To opt out of targeted ads, the DAA AppChoices tool is available at<br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.DAA.appchoices&amp;hl=en",
